<tr><td style="padding:28px 24px 24px">
<div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#14213D"><h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#14213D">You&#39;re invited to be an admin</h1><p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><b>W. Perera</b> invited you to help manage <b>Siripura Central College</b> on Sathiya, where the school builds its timetables.</p><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 2px"><tr><td style="background:#7A1F3D;border-radius:8px"><a href="https://app.example.test/login" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:20px">Accept invite</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#5A6378">Sign in with this email address, with Google or a password. The invite waits for you.</p></div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 14px"><tr><td width="50%" style="vertical-align:middle"><div style="height:1px;background:#ECEDF1;line-height:1px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</div></td><td style="padding:0 10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',Inter,Arial,sans-serif"><span style="display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#F1F2F5;color:#3B4560;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap">සිංහල</span></td><td width="50%" style="vertical-align:middle"><div style="height:1px;background:#ECEDF1;line-height:1px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></table>
<div style="font-family:'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#3B4560"><h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;color:#14213D">පරිපාලකයෙකු ලෙස එක්වන්න</h2><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">සිරිපුර මධ්‍ය මහා විද්‍යාලය පාසලේ Sathiya පරිපාලකයෙකු ලෙස එක්වීමට W. Perera ඔබට ආරාධනා කර ඇත. ඉහත බොත්තම ඔබන්න.</p></div>
</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0;padding:18px 24px 0;text-align:center;font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6378">Sent by Sathiya (සතිය) for Siripura Central College. Not expecting this? Ignore it.</p>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>",
  "subject": "Join Siripura Central College on Sathiya (සතිය)",
  "text": "You're invited to be an admin

W. Perera invited you to help manage Siripura Central College on Sathiya, where the school builds its timetables.

Accept invite: https://app.example.test/login

Sign in with this email address, with Google or a password. The invite waits for you.

---

පරිපාලකයෙකු ලෙස එක්වන්න

සිරිපුර මධ්‍ය මහා විද්‍යාලය පාසලේ Sathiya පරිපාලකයෙකු ලෙස එක්වීමට W. Perera ඔබට ආරාධනා කර ඇත. ඉහත බොත්තම ඔබන්න.

--
Sent by Sathiya (සතිය) for Siripura Central College. Not expecting this? Ignore it.",
}
`;

