<tr><td style="padding:28px 24px 24px">
<div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#14213D"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;background:#FBEAEA;border-radius:8px"><tr><td style="padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#A3262A"><span style="display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#A3262A;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap">&#9679;&nbsp;Suspended</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Sign-in is off for admins and teachers.</td></tr></table><h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#14213D">Your school is suspended</h1><p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><b>Siripura Central College</b> has been suspended on Sathiya. Admins and teachers can&#39;t sign in until it is reactivated.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Your timetables and setup are kept.</p><p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#5A6378">Think this is a mistake? Reply to this email.</p></div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 14px"><tr><td width="50%" style="vertical-align:middle"><div style="height:1px;background:#ECEDF1;line-height:1px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</div></td><td style="padding:0 10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',Inter,Arial,sans-serif"><span style="display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#F1F2F5;color:#3B4560;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap">සිංහල</span></td><td width="50%" style="vertical-align:middle"><div style="height:1px;background:#ECEDF1;line-height:1px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></table>
<div style="font-family:'Noto Sans Sinhala','Iskoola Pota','Nirmala UI',Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#3B4560"><h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;color:#14213D">ඔබගේ පාසල අත්හිටුවා ඇත</h2><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">සිරිපුර මධ්‍ය මහා විද්‍යාලය Sathiya හි අත්හිටුවා ඇත. නැවත සක්‍රිය කරන තෙක් පරිපාලකයන්ට සහ ගුරුවරුන්ට පිවිසිය නොහැක.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;">ඔබගේ දත්ත ආරක්ෂිතව තබා ඇත.</p><p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#5A6378">මෙය වැරදීමක් යැයි ඔබ සිතන්නේ නම් මෙම ඊමේලයට පිළිතුරු දෙන්න.</p></div>
</td></tr>
